                    "content": "```kotlin\nimport java.io.BufferedReader\nimport java.io.InputStreamReader\nimport java.util.StringTokenizer\n\nfun modpow(base: Long, exp: Long, mod: Long): Long {\n    var result = 1L\n    var b = base % mod\n    if (b < 0) b += mod\n    var e = exp\n    while (e > 0) {\n        if (e and 1L == 1L) result = result * b % mod\n        b = b * b % mod\n        e = e shr 1\n    }\n    return result\n}\n\nfun main() {\n    val br = BufferedReader(InputStreamReader(System.`in`))\n    val st = StringTokenizer(br.readLine())\n    val a = st.nextToken().toLong()\n    val b = st.nextToken().toLong()\n    val p = st.nextToken().toLong()\n    val x = st.nextToken().toLong()\n\n    // factorize p-1\n    var temp = p - 1\n    val primeFactors = mutableListOf<Long>()\n    var i = 2L\n    while (i * i <= temp) {\n        if (temp % i == 0L) {\n            primeFactors.add(i)\n            while (temp % i == 0L) temp /= i\n        }\n        i++\n    }\n    if (temp > 1) primeFactors.add(temp)\n\n    var d = p - 1\n    for (q in primeFactors) {\n        while (d % q == 0L && modpow(a, d / q, p) == 1L) {\n            d /= q\n        }\n    }\n\n    val invA = modpow(a, p - 2, p)\n    val invD = modpow(d % p, p - 2, p) // d < p, d >= 1, so d mod p = d, invertible\n    val L = d * p\n\n    var count = 0L\n    var invAr = 1L // invA^0\n    var r = 0L\n    while (r < d) {\n        val cr = (b * invAr) % p\n        var diff = (cr - r) % p\n        if (diff < 0) diff += p\n        val t0 = diff * invD % p\n        var n0 = r + d * t0\n        if (n0 == 0L) n0 = L\n        if (n0 <= x) {\n            count += (x - n0) / L + 1\n        }\n        invAr = invAr * invA % p\n        r++\n    }\n\n    println(count)\n}\n```",
